{%- comment -%}
  Zo Veilig — offertewizard boven de Zelf samenstellen-grid (2026-11-17). Vier korte vragen, de vorm van
  de oude offertebuilder, op de huidige producten. Het is GEEN prijsberekening en geen pakketkiezer: de
  wizard filtert/markeert alleen de bestaande grid (sections/zelf-samenstellen.liquid) en vult het
  terugbelformulier voor. Logica in assets/zv-offerte-wizard.js; deze file levert alleen markup, tekst en
  de koppelingen vraag -> grid-categorie.

  Koppelingen staan als data-attributen op de opties, zodat de JS generiek blijft:
    data-cats   spatie-gescheiden categorieen van de grid (sensoren, camera, deurbel, bediening);
                de grid-filter wordt de UNIE van Q1 en Q4.
    data-d      korte tekst voor de regel "Offertewizard: ..." die als `description` met de lead meegaat.
    data-floors aantal etages (Q3); 2 of meer toont de Woning-toelichting in de grid.
    data-types  (Q4) beperkt de categorie van die optie tot rijen met dit `type` in de grid
                (Binnencamera -> Binnen, Buitencamera -> Buiten). Zo'n optie VERSMALT ook Q1's
                camera-categorie; een leeg resultaat valt in de grid terug op de hele categorie.
    data-tier-* (Q2) pakketadvies uit de sectie-instellingen hieronder (per woningtype een pakket, leeg =
                geen advies). De mapping woningtype -> pakket is NIET bevestigd (Thijs/Robi), dus er staat
                bewust niets ingevuld; zie docs/zelf-samenstellen-wizard-2026-11-17.md.

  Q2 (type woning) en Q3 (etages) filteren de grid niet: die heeft geen pakketten en geen Woning-regel
  (die hoort bij een pakketregel en wordt los door de winkelwagen-guard verwijderd). Q2 toont, als er een
  mapping is ingesteld, een "Ons advies"-balk (zelfde opmaak als .pm-advies van de pakket-matcher) met een
  link naar /pages/oplossingen?pakket=<finder_key> (de bestaande Keuzehulp-koppeling: opent dat pakket);
  beide antwoorden reizen mee in de lead. Q3 toont vanaf 2 etages alleen een toelichting. Geen bedragen,
  geen productcodes in deze file (scripts/check_pricing.py).
{%- endcomment -%}
{% comment %}theme-check-disable DeprecatedTag, UndefinedObject{% endcomment %}
{%- include 'zv-pricing' -%}
{%- assign zv_wiz_names = zv_package_names_by_fk -%}
{% comment %}theme-check-enable DeprecatedTag, UndefinedObject{% endcomment %}

<div class="zv-wiz" data-zv-wizard>
  <div class="wrap">
    <form class="zvw-card" id="zvwForm" novalidate aria-labelledby="zvw-title">
      <div class="zvw-head">
        <h2 id="zvw-title">{{ section.settings.title | default: 'Stel uw beveiliging samen in 4 vragen' | escape }}</h2>
        <p>{{ section.settings.lead | default: 'Beantwoord vier korte vragen. Daarna laten we de onderdelen zien die erbij passen en nemen we uw antwoorden mee in uw terugbelverzoek.' | escape }}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zvw-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span class="zvw-bar" id="zvwBar"></span></div>
      <p class="zvw-count" id="zvwCount" aria-live="polite">Vraag 1 van 4</p>

      <fieldset class="zvw-step" data-step="1" data-name="beveiliging">
        <legend tabindex="-1">Hoe wilt u uw woning beveiligen?<span class="zvw-sub">Kies alles wat past.</span></legend>
        <div class="zvw-opts">
          <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="checkbox" name="beveiliging" value="alarm" data-cats="sensoren bediening" data-d="Alarmsysteem"><span>Met een alarmsysteem</span></label>
          <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="checkbox" name="beveiliging" value="camera" data-cats="camera" data-d="Camera's"><span>Met camera's</span></label>
          <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="checkbox" name="beveiliging" value="deurbel" data-cats="deurbel" data-d="Videodeurbel"><span>Met een video deurbel</span></label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="zvw-step" data-step="2" data-name="woning" hidden>
        <legend tabindex="-1">Wat voor type woning heeft u?</legend>
        <div class="zvw-opts">
          {%- assign zv_wiz_wk = 'appartement|rijtjeswoning|vrijstaand' | split: '|' -%}
          {%- assign zv_wiz_wl = 'Appartement|Rijtjeswoning|Vrijstaand' | split: '|' -%}
          {%- capture zv_wiz_url -%}{%- render 'zv-route', key: 'oplossingen' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- for wk in zv_wiz_wk -%}
            {%- assign fk_id = 'tier_' | append: wk -%}
            {%- assign tx_id = 'text_' | append: wk -%}
            {%- assign fk = section.settings[fk_id] -%}
            {%- assign tier_name = '' -%}
            {%- if fk != blank -%}{%- capture tier_name -%}{%- render 'zv-package-name', finder_key: fk, names: zv_wiz_names -%}{%- endcapture -%}{%- endif -%}
            <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="radio" name="woning" value="{{ wk }}" data-d="{{ zv_wiz_wl[forloop.index0] }}"
              {%- if tier_name != blank %} data-tier-name="{{ tier_name | escape }}" data-tier-href="{{ zv_wiz_url | strip }}?pakket={{ fk | url_encode }}" data-tier-text="{{ section.settings[tx_id] | escape }}"{% endif %}><span>{{ zv_wiz_wl[forloop.index0] }}</span></label>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <div class="zvw-advies" id="zvwAdvies" aria-live="polite" hidden>
          <span class="zvw-advies__chk" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
          <p class="zvw-advies__txt"><b>{{ section.settings.advies_label | default: 'Ons advies:' | escape }} <span id="zvwAdviesName"></span>.</b> <span id="zvwAdviesText"></span></p>
          <a class="zvw-advies__cta" id="zvwAdviesLink" href="{{ zv_wiz_url | strip }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ section.settings.advies_cta | default: 'Bekijk dit pakket' | escape }}<span class="zvw-sr"> (opent in een nieuw tabblad)</span></a>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="zvw-step" data-step="3" data-name="etages" hidden>
        <legend tabindex="-1">Uit hoeveel etages bestaat uw woning?</legend>
        <div class="zvw-opts">
          <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="radio" name="etages" value="1" data-floors="1" data-d="1 etage"><span>1 etage</span></label>
          <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="radio" name="etages" value="2" data-floors="2" data-d="2 etages"><span>2 etages</span></label>
          <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="radio" name="etages" value="3" data-floors="3" data-d="3 etages"><span>3 etages</span></label>
          <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="radio" name="etages" value="4" data-floors="4" data-d="4 etages"><span>4 etages</span></label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="zvw-step" data-step="4" data-name="camera" hidden>
        <legend tabindex="-1">Welke camera heeft uw interesse?</legend>
        <div class="zvw-opts">
          <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="radio" name="camera" value="geen" data-cats="" data-d="Geen camera"><span>Geen</span></label>
          <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="radio" name="camera" value="deurbelcamera" data-cats="deurbel" data-d="Deurbelcamera"><span>Deurbelcamera</span></label>
          <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="radio" name="camera" value="binnencamera" data-cats="camera" data-types="Binnen" data-d="Binnencamera"><span>Binnencamera</span></label>
          <label class="zvw-opt"><input type="radio" name="camera" value="buitencamera" data-cats="camera" data-types="Buiten" data-d="Buitencamera"><span>Buitencamera</span></label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <div class="zvw-err" id="zvwErr" role="alert" hidden></div>

      <div class="zvw-nav">
        <button type="button" class="zvw-back" id="zvwBack" hidden>Vorige</button>
        <button type="submit" class="zvw-next" id="zvwNext">Volgende</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="{{ 'zv-offerte-wizard.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{% stylesheet %}
.zv-wiz {
  --ink:#1a1230; --indigo:#322469; --indigo-2:#473a86; --indigo-soft:#efecf7;
  --cream:#fdfaf2; --paper:#fffdf8; --gold:#e4a311; --belt:#9c6c08;
  --red:#e24b4a; --rood:#c52e2f; --line:#e8e0cd; --line-2:#ded6c0; --muted:#6f6786;
  color:var(--ink); line-height:1.5; background:#fbf5e9;
}
.zv-wiz .wrap { max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:clamp(24px,3.4vw,44px) clamp(16px,3.4vw,48px); }
.zv-wiz .zvw-card { background:var(--paper); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; padding:clamp(18px,2.6vw,30px); box-shadow:0 26px 56px -42px rgba(26,18,48,.5); display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:18px; max-width:860px; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-head h2 { font-size:clamp(21px,2.6vw,28px); font-weight:900; letter-spacing:-.015em; line-height:1.15; color:var(--indigo); margin:0; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-head p { font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:var(--muted); margin:8px 0 0; max-width:620px; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-progress { height:6px; border-radius:99px; background:var(--indigo-soft); overflow:hidden; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-bar { display:block; height:100%; width:25%; background:var(--indigo); border-radius:99px; transition:width .25s ease; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-count { font-size:12.5px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); margin:-8px 0 0; }
.zv-wiz fieldset { border:0; margin:0; padding:0; min-width:0; }
.zv-wiz fieldset[hidden], .zv-wiz .zvw-err[hidden], .zv-wiz .zvw-back[hidden] { display:none; }
.zv-wiz legend { display:block; padding:0; font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,21px); font-weight:900; color:var(--indigo); letter-spacing:-.01em; line-height:1.3; margin-bottom:14px; }
.zv-wiz legend:focus { outline:none; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-sub { display:block; margin-top:2px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:0; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-opts { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-opt { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-size:15px; font-weight:800; color:var(--indigo); background:#fff; border:1.5px solid var(--line-2); border-radius:12px; padding:12px 16px; cursor:pointer; transition:border-color .14s,background .14s; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-opt:hover { border-color:var(--indigo); }
.zv-wiz .zvw-opt input { width:18px; height:18px; margin:0; flex:none; accent-color:var(--indigo); }
.zv-wiz .zvw-opt:has(input:checked) { border-color:var(--indigo); background:var(--indigo-soft); }
.zv-wiz .zvw-opt:has(input:focus-visible) { outline:2px solid var(--indigo); outline-offset:3px; }
.zv-wiz .is-missing legend { color:var(--rood); }
.zv-wiz .is-missing .zvw-opt { border-color:var(--red); }
.zv-wiz .zvw-err { font-size:13.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--rood); }
.zv-wiz .zvw-advies { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:16px; background:#fff; border:1.5px solid var(--indigo); border-radius:16px; padding:14px 16px 14px 18px; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-advies[hidden] { display:none; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-advies__chk { flex:none; width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--indigo-soft); color:var(--indigo); display:grid; place-items:center; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-advies__chk svg { width:16px; height:16px; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-advies__txt { flex:1 1 240px; font-size:15px; font-weight:500; color:#5b5374; line-height:1.45; margin:0; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-advies__txt b { color:var(--indigo); font-weight:900; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-advies__cta { flex:none; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:800; color:var(--ink); background:var(--gold); border-radius:12px; padding:11px 18px; text-decoration:none; box-shadow:0 2px 0 var(--belt); }
.zv-wiz .zvw-advies__cta:focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--indigo); outline-offset:3px; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-sr { position:absolute; width:1px; height:1px; margin:-1px; padding:0; overflow:hidden; clip:rect(0,0,0,0); white-space:nowrap; border:0; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-nav { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:12px; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-next, .zv-wiz .zvw-back { font-family:inherit; font-size:15.5px; font-weight:800; border-radius:13px; padding:14px 22px; cursor:pointer; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-next { color:var(--ink); background:var(--gold); border:none; box-shadow:0 2px 0 var(--belt); transition:transform .14s,box-shadow .14s; }
.zv-wiz .zvw-next:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:0 4px 0 var(--belt),0 12px 24px -12px rgba(180,126,10,.7); }
.zv-wiz .zvw-back { color:var(--indigo); background:#fff; border:1.5px solid var(--line-2); }
.zv-wiz .zvw-back:hover { border-color:var(--indigo); }
.zv-wiz .zvw-next:focus-visible, .zv-wiz .zvw-back:focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--indigo); outline-offset:3px; }
@media(max-width:520px){ .zv-wiz .zvw-advies__cta { flex-basis:100%; text-align:center; } .zv-wiz .zvw-opt { flex:1 1 100%; } .zv-wiz .zvw-nav { flex-direction:column-reverse; align-items:stretch; } .zv-wiz .zvw-next, .zv-wiz .zvw-back { text-align:center; } }
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .zv-wiz .zvw-bar { transition:none; } }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Zelf samenstellen wizard",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Titel", "default": "Stel uw beveiliging samen in 4 vragen" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "lead", "label": "Introductie", "default": "Beantwoord vier korte vragen. Daarna laten we de onderdelen zien die erbij passen en nemen we uw antwoorden mee in uw terugbelverzoek." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Pakketadvies bij vraag 2", "info": "Leeg = geen advies voor dat woningtype. Mapping nog niet bevestigd, dus standaard leeg. De link opent het gekozen pakket op Oplossingen." },
    { "type": "select", "id": "tier_appartement", "label": "Appartement", "default": "", "options": [{ "value": "", "label": "Geen advies" }, { "value": "aware", "label": "Inzicht" }, { "value": "aware_plus", "label": "Zeker" }, { "value": "care", "label": "Beschermd" }, { "value": "secure", "label": "Alert" }, { "value": "guard", "label": "Protect" }, { "value": "secure_plus", "label": "Vista" }] },
    { "type": "text", "id": "text_appartement", "label": "Toelichting appartement (optioneel)" },
    { "type": "select", "id": "tier_rijtjeswoning", "label": "Rijtjeswoning", "default": "", "options": [{ "value": "", "label": "Geen advies" }, { "value": "aware", "label": "Inzicht" }, { "value": "aware_plus", "label": "Zeker" }, { "value": "care", "label": "Beschermd" }, { "value": "secure", "label": "Alert" }, { "value": "guard", "label": "Protect" }, { "value": "secure_plus", "label": "Vista" }] },
    { "type": "text", "id": "text_rijtjeswoning", "label": "Toelichting rijtjeswoning (optioneel)" },
    { "type": "select", "id": "tier_vrijstaand", "label": "Vrijstaand", "default": "", "options": [{ "value": "", "label": "Geen advies" }, { "value": "aware", "label": "Inzicht" }, { "value": "aware_plus", "label": "Zeker" }, { "value": "care", "label": "Beschermd" }, { "value": "secure", "label": "Alert" }, { "value": "guard", "label": "Protect" }, { "value": "secure_plus", "label": "Vista" }] },
    { "type": "text", "id": "text_vrijstaand", "label": "Toelichting vrijstaand (optioneel)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "advies_label", "label": "Label advies", "default": "Ons advies:" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "advies_cta", "label": "Knoptekst advies", "default": "Bekijk dit pakket" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Zelf samenstellen wizard" }]
}
{% endschema %}
